      "writtenOn": "2026-08-31T11:20:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am doing this to follows the redfish schema.\nFrom the redfish schema perspective, a port can only appears under a Redfish Switch/NetworkAdapter if it publishes `connected_to` to that object.\n\nTherefore, the proposed logic is to lookup if there is any parent entity type of `Network Controller` for the port entity. If so, we will then create association for them, representing the connection.",
